  "name": "Question 11",
  "problem": "The ratio of boys to the total number of children in a birthday party is $4:7.$ What is the meaning of this ratio?",
  "worked_solution": "If the ratio of boys to total children is $4:7,$ it means that there are $4$ boys for every $7$ children at the birthday party.\n\nAnother way of writing this is to say that \"out of every $7$ children at the birthday party, $4$ of them are boys.\"",
